  "_3_settings_top": "设置页 —— 顶部",
  "\"Internal variables and functions\"": "\"内置变量与函数\"",
  "\"Templater provides multiples predefined variables / functions that you can use.\"": "\"Templater 内置了一批可以直接用的变量与函数。\"",
  "\"Check the \"": "\"查看\"",
  "text:\"documentation\"": "text:\"官方文档\"",
  "\" to get a list of all the available internal variables / functions.\"": "\"，里面列了全部内置变量与函数。\"",
  "\"Template folder location\"": "\"模板文件夹\"",
  "\"Files in this folder will be available as templates.\"": "\"这个文件夹里的文件会作为模板出现。\"",
  "\"Template hotkeys\"": "\"模板快捷键\"",
  "\"Bind templates to \"": "\"把模板绑成\"",
  "text:\"commands\"": "text:\"命令\"",
  "\". Bind commands to \"": "\"，再到\"",
  "text:\"hotkeys\"": "text:\"快捷键\"",
  "' in \"Hotkeys\" settings.'": "'设置里给它指定按键。'",
  "\"Automatic jump to cursor\"": "\"自动跳到光标位置\"",
  "\"Automatically triggers \"": "\"插入模板后自动执行 \"",
  "\" after inserting a template.\"": "\"。\"",
  "\"You can also set a hotkey to manually trigger \"": "\"也可以绑一个快捷键手动触发 \"",
  "\"Jump to note content after creating note\"": "\"建好笔记后直接进正文\"",
  "\"When creating a new note from a template, skip the rename prompt and immediately move the cursor to the note body.\"": "\"从模板新建笔记时跳过重命名提示，光标直接落到正文。\"",

  "_4_syntax": "语法高亮",
  "heading:\"Syntax highlighting\"": "heading:\"语法高亮\"",
  "\"Syntax highlighting on desktop\"": "\"桌面端语法高亮\"",
  "\"Adds syntax highlighting for Templater commands in edit mode.\"": "\"在编辑模式下高亮 Templater 命令。\"",
  "\"Syntax highlighting on mobile\"": "\"移动端语法高亮\"",
  "\"Adds syntax highlighting for Templater commands in edit mode on mobile. Use with caution: this may break live preview on mobile platforms.\"": "\"在移动端编辑模式下高亮 Templater 命令。慎用：可能弄坏移动端的实时预览。\"",

  "_5_file_creation": "新建文件时触发",
  "heading:\"File creation\"": "heading:\"新建文件\"",
  "\"Trigger Templater on new file creation\"": "\"新建文件时自动触发 Templater\"",
  "\"Templater will listen for the new file creation event, and, if it matches a rule you've set, replace every command it finds in the new file's content. \"": "\"Templater 会监听新建文件事件；命中你设的规则时，把新文件内容里的模板命令全部执行掉。\"",
  "\"This makes Templater compatible with other plugins like the Daily note core plugin, Calendar plugin, Review plugin, Note refactor plugin, etc. \"": "\"这样它就能和日记、Calendar、Review、Note refactor 等插件配合。\"",
  "\"This setting is stored on this device only and must be enabled separately on each device.\"": "\"这个设置只存在本机，每台设备都要单独开一次。\"",
  "\"Excluded folders\"": "\"排除的文件夹\"",
  "\"New files created in these folders will never trigger Templater.\"": "\"在这些文件夹里新建的文件永远不会触发 Templater。\"",
  "\"Template matching mode\"": "\"模板匹配方式\"",
  "\"Choose the matching mode for triggering templates on file creation.\"": "\"选择新建文件时按什么方式匹配模板。\"",
  "\"None: Do not auto apply templates. Templater will still listen for the new file creation event and replace every command it finds in the new file's content.\"": "\"None：不自动套模板。Templater 仍会监听新建事件，并执行新文件内容里已有的模板命令。\"",
  "\"Folder templates: Apply templates based on folder structure.\"": "\"文件夹模板：按文件夹结构套模板。\"",
  "\"File regex templates: Apply templates based on regex file name patterns.\"": "\"文件名正则模板：按文件名正则套模板。\"",
  "none:\"None\"": "none:\"不自动套\"",
  "\"Folder templates\"": "\"文件夹模板\"",
  "\"File regex templates\"": "\"文件名正则模板\"",
  "\"If there is a match, Templater will apply the corresponding template to the new file.\"": "\"命中规则时，Templater 会把对应模板套到新文件上。\"",
  "\"The most specific (deepest) matching folder wins, so a rule for a subfolder takes precedence over a rule for its parent.\"": "\"取匹配最深的那一条，子文件夹的规则优先于父文件夹。\"",
  "\"Add a rule for \"": "\"需要兜底的话，给 \"",
  "\" if you need a catch-all.\"": "\" 加一条规则。\"",
  "\"File regex templates are applied based on the regex file path patterns you define.\"": "\"按你写的文件路径正则来套模板。\"",
  "\"File regex templates are processed in order, so if a file matches multiple regex templates, only the first match will be applied.\"": "\"规则按顺序匹配；一个文件命中多条时，只套第一条。\"",

