  "_9b_danger": "开启危险设置时的二次确认弹窗（title 复用了上面的设置名）",
  "warning:\"This can be dangerous if you set a startup template with unknown/unsafe content. Make sure that every startup template's content is safe.\"": "warning:\"如果启动模板里是来路不明的内容，这会有风险。请确保每个启动模板的内容都是安全的。\"",
  "warning:\"This can be dangerous if you create new files with unknown / unsafe content on creation. Make sure that every new file's content is safe on creation.\"": "warning:\"如果新建的文件带着来路不明的内容，这会有风险。请确保每个新文件的初始内容都是安全的。\"",
  "warning:\"It can be dangerous to execute arbitrary system commands from untrusted sources. Only run system commands that you understand, from trusted sources.\"": "warning:\"执行来路不明的系统命令很危险。只跑你看得懂、来源可信的命令。\"",

